# Skill: Run AI Evals (@RunEvals)

When invoked with `@RunEvals`, execute the following procedure:
1. Resolve active prompt versions from `apps/backend/src/config/prompts/` (`ACTIVE_PROMPT_VERSIONS` / `listActivePromptVersions()`). Record which semantic versions will be benchmarked.
2. Run the local evaluation runner: `npm run eval` (golden dataset against versioned prompts under `apps/backend/src/config/prompts/`).
3. Parse the generated report from `evals/output/report.json`.
4. Format a markdown scorecard displaying:
   - Prompt versions under test (name + semver)
   - Total test cases evaluated
   - Recall@k Score
   - Grounding Accuracy %
   - Schema Validation Success Rate %
   - p95 Latency (ms) & Estimated USD Cost
5. Flag any regressed prompt test cases that scored lower than previous runs.
